# scripts/check.conf — the steps behind the single verification contract (./scripts/check).
# Generated by the bootstrap workflow; this example shows the format.
# One step per line:  <name>: <command>   — runs in order, fails fast.
# Every command must leave nothing running (docs/testing.md, Resource hygiene).
# Tag quick steps with [fast] in the NAME (never in the command): ./scripts/check --fast runs only
# those; ./scripts/check runs all (docs/testing.md, Two speeds, one contract).
#
# JVM (Gradle, Java) example:
# resource hygiene: no Gradle daemon
# build [fast]: ./gradlew assemble --no-daemon
# test: ./gradlew test --no-daemon
#
# Node example:
# lint: npm run lint
# typecheck: npm run typecheck
# test: npm test
#
# Python example:
# lint: ruff check .
# types: mypy .
# test: pytest -q
